      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WEST ON MENACE (1) was out of the placings last time when sixth at this track (35.43) but did record best time of the card when winning four back. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and three minor placings from nine starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. ASTON RULER (8) goes very well this trip starting 19 times for nine wins and five minors. Comes off a (29.90) win last time, scoring by 1.3 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 520m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. SWEET BEE (4) got around 601m in a handy 34.64 when winning a Grade 4/5 at this track last start. Harder here but expected to measure up. JUST A BINDI (2) has been in the frame at her last two runs, most recently when second (34.97) in a Grade 5 over 601m at this track.",
